  "prefLabel": "Fis 1510.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1510.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to describe sound level limits and test procedures to be used by conservation officers to detect the exhaust sound emissions of stationary snowmobiles for the purpose of enforcing RSA 215-C: 28.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 1500) #12590, eff 7-25-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis1500.html"
